What this license covers

The code, the page design, the watch-order compilation (which titles belong to
which continuity, their story order and in-story dates) and the original text
are covered by the license above.

It does not cover material that belongs to others and is shown here under their
own terms:

- Ratings, runtimes and episode counts from IMDb's non-commercial datasets
  (https://data.imdb.com/non-commercial-datasets/), which IMDb licenses
  for personal, non-commercial use only. Information courtesy of IMDb
  (https://www.imdb.com). Used with permission.
- Ratings and titles from Douban and scores from Rotten Tomatoes, which
  remain theirs.
- Release dates and other facts from Wikipedia and Wikidata.
- Posters (site/posters/), which belong to their studios and rights holders.
- Film, series and franchise names, which are trademarks of their owners.

This is an unofficial fan index, not affiliated with any studio or rights
holder.
